  "markdown": "top of page\n\nSkip to Main Content\n\n## OUR STORY\n\nIt’s been said that meetings and events have literally made the world go around. From the last supper to the very first US constitutional convention to the investigator meetings that resulted in the groundbreaking cancer treatments of today, meetings and events have been brining people together to effect monumental, positive change. Limestone meetings and events prescribes to the notion that, when you bring people together you can change the world. Whether your objectives are centered around training, strategic goal setting, long-term planning or any number of other initiatives that allow your business to run more effectively, our team is dedicated to providing event support that allows you to focus to rest upon harnessing the richness of the outcome.\n\n​\n\nLimestone meetings and events is a nexus of decades of specialized events experience, strategic leadership consulting and a vision for agile event solutions that truly can be a catalyst.\n\n## OUR TEAM\n\n![](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/b2c0a7_0dfa9e2ad0112a8515045331b855b84d.png/v1/fill/w_180,h_180,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/b2c0a7_0dfa9e2ad0112a8515045331b855b84d.png)\n\n###### Gretchen Mitchell\n\nVice President of Finance\n\nI'm a paragraph. Click here to add your own text and edit me. It’s easy. Just click “Edit Text” or double click me to add your own content and make changes to the font.\n\n![](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/b2c0a7_5dd0ed2059b6b2763151c379f489a264.png/v1/fill/w_180,h_180,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/b2c0a7_5dd0ed2059b6b2763151c379f489a264.png)\n\n###### Michelle Donahue Lorra\n\nDirector of Operations\n\nI'm a paragraph. Click here to add your own text and edit me. It’s easy. Just click “Edit Text” or double click me to add your own content and make changes to the font.\n\n![Elegant Female](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/f3b048156eb84599b5ea280b53c07c92.jpg/v1/fill/w_180,h_180,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Elegant%20Female.jpg)\n\n###### Krista Gibson\n\nSales Manager\n\nI'm a paragraph. Click here to add your own text and edit me. It’s easy. Just click “Edit Text”or double click me to add your own content and makechanges to the font.\n\n## OUR CLIENTS\n\nFor over 20 years, our team has honed our experience servicing corporate clientele around the world. Today, our customer based is comprised mainly of Executive teams, Boards of Directors from various sectors as well as Sales organizations.\n\n## TESTIMONIALS\n\n“DOUBLE CLICK HERE OR CLICK EDIT TEXT TO ADD SOME POSITIVE FEEDBACK ABOUT YOUR SERVICES\"\n\nNAME / JOB / TITLE\n\n“DOUBLE CLICK HERE OR CLICK EDIT TEXT TO ADD SOME POSITIVE FEEDBACK ABOUT YOUR SERVICES\"\n\nNAME / JOB / TITLE\n\n[![REACH logo](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_b6659293240c40db888d813137f151bc~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_240,h_100,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Reach%20Logo%20jpg.jpg)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/)\n\nbottom of page",
